    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well to Hell is a claustrophobic first-person horror game about an urban explorer who gets trapped at the bottom of a well. To escape, you'll have to navigate around, find places to hide and look for tools to open different areas. Find a way out before it finds you...    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Summary:</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full of exploration and curiosity. Till now, you've explored the deepest depths, the tallest structures, and forgotten locations that once thrived. We set out to explore a creepy abandoned property not far from home. As you lurk around, you come across an old looking well, totally out of commision. You\u00a0contemplate on scaling down to further explore. Why not?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well to Hell is a claustrophobic first-person horror game about an urban explorer who gets trapped at the bottom of a well. To escape, you'll have to navigate around, find places to hide and look for tools to open different areas. Find a way out before it finds you...    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Summary:</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full of exploration and curiosity. Till now, you've explored the deepest depths, the tallest structures, and forgotten locations that once thrived. We set out to explore a creepy abandoned property not far from home. As you lurk around, you come across an old looking well, totally out of commision. You\u00a0contemplate on scaling down to further explore. Why not?</p>",
